<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d17acbc3-56df-57ae-85fc-d500b722c4de" activityNameId="9f4b67ee-39fb-5d5c-a329-8346f22d7158" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electronic component production plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electronic component production plant
The functional unit represents a production site for the production of electronic components. Described is AMD’s site in Dresden (Germany), comprising 2 Fabs for the production of Microprocessors. Process data is taken mainly from literature, plus from own estimations. The described plant has an output of 2 Mio pieces per year over a time span of 25 years. In 2023, no major updates are implemented for this dataset, except for the use of updated ICT datasets in the background/inventory, e.g. electronic component machinery, cables, etc.; UUID: 132d38e7-b07e-30a8-8d66-fe05434e2256
This module includes land use, buildings and facilities (machinery, cables, etc.) as well as the respective disposal activities of a microprocessor production site, used as example for a electronic component plant.
Location: This module relates to the global situation.
Technology: The AMD site in Saxony is taken as representative of a typical electronic components plant
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: about 1 Mio. pieces per year
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_132d38e7-b07e-30a8-8d66-fe05434e2256.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
